e and find the hidden faulty nodes across a shifting and changing sequence of network matrices. One wrong vector, and the system dead-ends.  The puzzles start easy and get progressively more difficult.  Can you become a Grand Master and solve the ultimate puzzle.  \n\nBASICS\n\n■ 100 HAND-CRAFTED LOGIC LABYRINTHS\nNo procedural generation. Every single node deployment, cross-axis interference field, and multi-deflection puzzle is mathematically tuned to push your logical deduction to its absolute limit.\n\n■ EVOLVING ARCHITECTURAL SCALING\nWatch the network scale in complexity as complete the puzzles. Advance through 5 distinct system sectors, expanding from accessible 4x4 calibration grids to massive, mind-bending 10x10 quantum arrays and asymmetric grids featuring quad-target engines and blind reflection zones.\n\n■ HARD-CORE RETRO TERMINAL IMMERSION; NO COMPLEX DISTRACTING GRAPHICS\nSettle into a beautifully atmospheric, zero-clutter visual interface complete with pulsing neon glyphs, authentic monospaced console logs, and a classic CRT digital display filter. \n\n■ SECURE OFFLINE TERMINAL\nNode Hunter is a fully self-contained experience. Built by developers who respect your hardware and privacy, this application operates 100% offline with zero data tracking, zero ad trackers, and no external background data transmission.  It's easy to play, difficult to win.  Challenge yourself.\n\nPLAY THE FIRST 10 PUZZLES FOR FREE\nLearn how the puzzles work and how to solve them.\n---\nSUPPORT: info@thewiseowlnest.com\nDEVELOPED BY: The Wise Owl Nest, LLC © June 2026", "sellerUrl": "https://node-hunter-backend.rork.app/node-hunter", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "minimumOsVersion": "18.0", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "3138560", "formattedPrice": "￦4,400", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "primaryGenreName": "Games", "primaryGenreId": 6014, "artistId": 1880440384, "artistName": "Joel Ospa", "userRatingCount": 0}]